<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>

<p>The International Workshop on AI-Driven Cyber Security and Privacy (AICSP 2026) aims to provide a platform for researchers, students, and industry practitioners to discuss emerging challenges and innovative solutions in the field of cyber security and privacy protection.</p>

<p>With the rapid development of artificial intelligence, cloud computing, blockchain, and large-scale network systems, cyber threats have become increasingly intelligent and complex. This workshop focuses on cutting-edge research topics related to network security, intelligent defense systems, privacy-preserving technologies, and secure computing.</p>

<p>AICSP 2026 welcomes original research papers, system demonstrations, and preliminary research ideas from academia and industry.</p>

<hr />

<h1 id="topics-of-interest">Topics of Interest</h1>

<p>Topics of interest include, but are not limited to:</p>

<h2 id="network-and-system-security">Network and System Security</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Network intrusion detection and prevention</li>
  <li>Malware analysis and detection</li>
  <li>Distributed system security</li>
  <li>Cloud and edge computing security</li>
  <li>Zero trust architecture</li>
  <li>Software and operating system security</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="artificial-intelligence-security">Artificial Intelligence Security</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Adversarial machine learning</li>
  <li>Security of large language models (LLMs)</li>
  <li>AI-generated attack and defense techniques</li>
  <li>Deepfake detection</li>
  <li>Federated learning security</li>
  <li>Explainable AI for cyber security</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="cryptography-and-privacy">Cryptography and Privacy</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Blockchain and smart contract security</li>
  <li>Privacy-preserving computation</li>
  <li>Secure multi-party computation</li>
  <li>Post-quantum cryptography</li>
  <li>Data encryption and authentication</li>
  <li>Differential privacy</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="emerging-security-applications">Emerging Security Applications</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Internet of Things (IoT) security</li>
  <li>Industrial control system security</li>
  <li>Autonomous vehicle security</li>
  <li>Mobile application security</li>
  <li>Digital forensics</li>
  <li>Security risk assessment</li>
</ul>

