<h1 id="submission-guidelines">Submission Guidelines</h1>

<h2 id="paper-format">Paper Format</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Papers must be written in English.</li>
  <li>Submissions should follow the standard IEEE conference format.</li>
  <li>Full papers: up to 6 pages (excluding references).</li>
  <li>Short papers/posters: up to 3 pages.</li>
  <li>Templates are available from the IEEE conference template website.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="review-policy">Review Policy</h2>

<p>AICSP 2026 adopts a <strong>double-blind peer review</strong> process.</p>

<p>Authors should ensure that:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Author names and affiliations are removed from the manuscript.</li>
  <li>Self-references do not reveal author identity.</li>
  <li>Submitted work is original and unpublished.</li>
</ul>

<p>Each paper will be reviewed by at least two reviewers based on:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Originality</li>
  <li>Technical quality</li>
  <li>Relevance to workshop topics</li>
  <li>Clarity of presentation</li>
  <li>Potential impact</li>
</ul>

